        <h2 class="k-faq-category" id="about-kaarigar">About Kaarigar</h2>
            <div class="k-faq-accordion">
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">What is Kaarigar?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Kaarigar is India's On-Demand B2B Workforce Platform that helps businesses hire verified workers for hourly shifts, daily work, temporary staffing, project-based assignments, and permanent roles. We connect employers with skilled and semi-skilled workers across industries through a technology-driven platform.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">How is Kaarigar different from a traditional staffing agency?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Unlike traditional staffing agencies that rely on manual processes, Kaarigar is a digital workforce marketplace. Employers can post requirements, receive applications from verified workers, review profiles, and hire through a single platform with greater speed and transparency.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Is Kaarigar a staffing company?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>No. Kaarigar is a technology platform that facilitates connections between employers and workers. Unless specifically agreed in writing, Kaarigar is not the employer of workers or the staffing contractor for jobs posted on the platform.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Which industries does Kaarigar serve?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Kaarigar supports businesses across multiple industries, including:</p>
                        <ul><li>Restaurants &amp; Cafés</li><li>Hotels &amp; Hospitality</li><li>Retail</li><li>Warehouses</li><li>Manufacturing</li><li>Hospitals &amp; Healthcare</li><li>Logistics &amp; Delivery</li><li>Facility Management</li><li>Commercial Offices</li><li>Events &amp; Exhibitions</li><li>Construction</li><li>Maintenance Services</li></ul>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Which cities does Kaarigar operate in?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Kaarigar is expanding city by city. Current service availability depends on active employer demand and worker availability in each location.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="k-faq-category" id="employer-faqs">Employer FAQs</h2>
            <div class="k-faq-accordion">
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Who can register as an employer?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Any legally operating business, including restaurants, hotels, retail stores, warehouses, factories, hospitals, logistics companies, event organizers, facility management companies, startups, MSMEs, and large enterprises, can register.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Is employer registration free?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Creating an employer account is free. Some platform features or premium hiring services may involve charges. Any applicable pricing will be displayed before purchase.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">How do I post a job?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>After registration and verification:</p>
                        <ul><li>Log in to your employer dashboard.</li><li>Click Post a Job.</li></ul>
                        <p>Enter the job details, location, schedule, pay rate, and required skills.</p>
                        <p>Publish the requirement.</p>
                        <p>Nearby eligible workers can then view and apply for your requirement.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">How quickly can I receive applications?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Application speed depends on factors such as location, pay offered, job timing, worker availability, and demand. In many cases, applications may begin arriving shortly after the job is published.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can I hire workers for only a few hours?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Kaarigar supports:</p>
                        <ul><li>Hourly shifts</li><li>Half-day shifts</li><li>Full-day shifts</li><li>Temporary assignments</li><li>Project-based work</li><li>Permanent hiring</li></ul>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can I edit a job after posting it?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Employers can edit or update eligible job details before the hiring process progresses, subject to platform rules.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can I cancel a posted job?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Jobs may be cancelled according to Kaarigar's Cancellation Policy. Depending on the timing of the cancellation, fees or restrictions may apply.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">How do I choose the right worker?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>You can review worker profiles, experience, skills, ratings (where available), and other relevant information before making your hiring decision.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Are workers verified?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Kaarigar may verify worker information such as identity, contact details, or documents. However, employers should independently evaluate whether a worker is suitable for a particular role.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Does Kaarigar guarantee worker performance?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>No. While we aim to build a trusted marketplace, Kaarigar cannot guarantee the conduct, skill, availability, punctuality, or performance of any worker.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="k-faq-category" id="worker-faqs">Worker FAQs</h2>
            <div class="k-faq-accordion">
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Who can register as a worker?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Any eligible individual seeking work in supported industries can register, subject to Kaarigar's verification requirements and Terms of Use.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Is worker registration free?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Worker registration is free.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">What documents may be required?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Depending on the role or verification level, workers may be asked to provide:</p>
                        <ul><li>Government-issued ID</li><li>Address proof</li><li>Bank account details</li><li>Relevant licences or certificates (where applicable)</li></ul>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can I apply for multiple jobs?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Workers may apply for multiple suitable jobs, provided they are available to fulfil the commitments if selected.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">How will I know if I am selected?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Employers may notify selected workers through the Kaarigar platform, SMS, email, phone call, or other available communication channels.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can I cancel an accepted job?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes, but frequent cancellations may affect your profile visibility, reliability score, or account status.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Will Kaarigar guarantee me work?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>No. Registration does not guarantee employment. Job availability depends on employer demand, worker eligibility, location, and other factors.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="k-faq-category" id="payments-earnings">Payments &amp; Earnings</h2>
            <div class="k-faq-accordion">
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">How are workers paid?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Payment methods depend on the employer's arrangement and the specific job. Where platform payments are enabled, payments will be processed according to the applicable payment terms.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Does Kaarigar charge workers?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Kaarigar's fee structure, if any, will be clearly communicated before any charge is applied.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can employers receive invoices?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Where applicable, invoices or payment records may be available through the employer dashboard.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="k-faq-category" id="verification-safety">Verification &amp; Safety</h2>
            <div class="k-faq-accordion">
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Why does Kaarigar verify users?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Verification helps improve trust, reduce fraud, and create a safer experience for both employers and workers.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Is my personal information secure?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. We implement reasonable safeguards to protect personal information in accordance with our Privacy Policy and applicable laws.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can I report inappropriate behaviour?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Users can report fraud, harassment, unsafe workplaces, fake profiles, or other policy violations through the platform or by contacting our support team.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="k-faq-category" id="ratings-reviews">Ratings &amp; Reviews</h2>
            <div class="k-faq-accordion">
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can employers rate workers?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Eligible employers may provide ratings and reviews after successful job completion.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can workers rate employers?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Eligible workers may also rate employers to promote transparency and accountability.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="k-faq-category" id="support">Support</h2>
            <div class="k-faq-accordion">
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">How do I contact Kaarigar?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>You can contact our support team through:</p>
                        <ul><li>Email : info@kaarigar.co</li><li>Phone : 09726728838</li><li>Website contact form : www.kaarigar.co</li></ul>
                        <p>Support details are available on our Contact Us page.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">How can I report a technical issue?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>You can report technical issues through the Help section within the platform or by contacting our support team with details of the problem.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="k-faq-category" id="legal">Legal</h2>
            <div class="k-faq-accordion">
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Is Kaarigar responsible for employment contracts?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>No. Unless expressly agreed otherwise in writing, employment relationships and contractual obligations remain between the employer and the worker.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Does Kaarigar conduct police verification?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Where available, Kaarigar may facilitate certain verification processes. However, unless expressly stated, Kaarigar does not guarantee police verification for all users.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Can Kaarigar suspend my account?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Yes. Accounts may be suspended or terminated for violations of our Terms of Use, Community Guidelines, fraudulent activity, misuse of the platform, or other policy breaches.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Is Kaarigar the employer of workers?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>No.</p>
                        <p>Kaarigar is a technology platform that enables businesses and workers to discover, connect and engage with each other.</p>
                        <p>Unless specifically agreed through a separate written agreement, Kaarigar does not employ workers, recruit workers as an employment agency, supervise day-to-day work, control work schedules, determine wages, or enter into employment contracts on behalf of employers.</p>
                        <p>The employment relationship, where applicable, exists directly between the employer and the worker.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Is Kaarigar a manpower contractor or labour supplier?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>No.</p>
                        <p>Kaarigar operates as a technology-enabled digital marketplace.</p>
                        <p>The platform facilitates workforce discovery and hiring between independent employers and workers.</p>
                        <p>Unless expressly agreed in writing under a separate commercial arrangement, Kaarigar does not provide manpower supply services, labour contracting services, or staffing services.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Who is responsible for labour law compliance?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>Unless otherwise agreed in writing, the employer engaging the worker through the Kaarigar Platform is solely responsible for complying with all applicable labour, employment, wage, social security, occupational safety, tax, and statutory laws applicable to that engagement.</p>
                        <p>These responsibilities may include, where applicable:</p>
                        <ul><li>Payment of wages</li><li>Working hours</li><li>Overtime</li><li>Leave</li><li>Statutory benefits</li><li>Workplace safety</li><li>Employee welfare</li><li>Social security obligations</li><li>Applicable taxes and statutory deductions</li><li>Compliance with all applicable Central and State laws</li></ul>
                        <p>Kaarigar does not assume these obligations merely by providing access to the platform.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Is Kaarigar the Principal Employer?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>No, in the ordinary use of the Platform.</p>
                        <p>Kaarigar operates as a technology marketplace that facilitates introductions between employers and workers.</p>
                        <p>Unless Kaarigar separately enters into a written agreement to provide staffing, outsourcing, payroll, contractor or employer services, Kaarigar does not act as the Principal Employer, Immediate Employer, Contractor, or Labour Supplier for jobs posted through the platform.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Does Kaarigar provide HR, payroll or compliance services?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="k-faq-item__body">
                        <p>No.</p>
                        <p>Unless specifically agreed in writing, Kaarigar does not provide:</p>
                        <ul><li>Payroll processing</li><li>Attendance management</li><li>PF administration</li><li>ESI administration</li><li>Bonus administration</li><li>Gratuity administration</li><li>Labour law compliance</li><li>Statutory filings</li><li>Employment documentation</li></ul>
                        <p>These responsibilities remain with the employer engaging the worker.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                <div class="k-faq-item">
                <button type="button" class="k-faq-item__head" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="k-faq-item__question">Why does Kaarigar verify workers if it is not the employer?</span>
                    <span class="k-faq-item__chevron">&#9662;</span>
                </button>
